---
---

<section class="serie-m" aria-label="Portal hacia la serie">
  <div class="serie-m__bg" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <span class="serie-m__runes" aria-hidden="true">ᚱᚨᛁᛞᛟ</span>

  <a class="serie-m__portal" href="/serie" aria-label="Entrar a la serie">
    <img
      src="/images/portal/webp/portal-base.webp"
      alt=""
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />
    <span class="serie-m__hint">
      <span class="hint-rune" aria-hidden="true">ᛈ</span>
      Toca el portal para entrar
      <span class="hint-rune" aria-hidden="true">ᛈ</span>
    </span>
  </a>

  <div class="serie-m__info">
    <p>
      Cruza la senda de piedra donde los antiguos caminos conducen hacia los
      salones de los dioses y los cuervos de Odín custodian la memoria del
      norte.
      <br /><br />
      Allí, bajo las ramas eternas de Yggdrasil, las voces olvidadas aún
      susurran entre la niebla y anuncian el destino de
      <span class="serie-m__title">Valheim: Larga vida a La Reina.</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  /* Solo visible en mobile */
  .serie-m {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .serie-m {
      display: flex;
    }
  }

  .serie-m {
    position: relative;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    width: 100%;
    min-height: 100svh;
    padding-bottom: 3.5rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0a0503;
  }

  /* Fondo atmosférico + degradado para legibilidad del texto */
  .serie-m__bg {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    background-image: url("/images/backgrounds/png/serie-bg.png");
    background-image: image-set(
      url("/images/backgrounds/avif/serie-bg.avif") type("image/avif"),
      url("/images/backgrounds/webp/serie-bg.webp") type("image/webp")
    );
    background-size: cover;
    background-position: center;
  }
  .serie-m__bg::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to bottom,
      transparent 0%,
      transparent 40%,
      rgba(8, 3, 1, 0.55) 60%,
      rgba(8, 3, 1, 0.94) 100%
    );
  }

  /* Runas decorativas */
  .serie-m__runes {
    position: absolute;
    top: 1.4rem;
    left: 0.9rem;
    z-index: 1;
    font-family: "Runes", "Cinzel", "Palatino Linotype", serif;
    letter-spacing: 0.6rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    color: #573c2a;
    opacity: 0.4;
    font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 11vw, 4rem);
    text-shadow: 0 0 2px #3d3020;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  /* Portal (tap → /serie) */
  .serie-m__portal {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .serie-m__portal img {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 46vh;
    object-fit: cover;
    /* Encuadra el arco (mitad derecha de la imagen) y lo centra */
    object-position: 70% 42%;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 10px 34px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6));
    transition: transform 0.4s ease;
  }
  .serie-m__portal:active img {
    transform: scale(1.02);
  }

  .serie-m__hint {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    bottom: 0;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    white-space: nowrap;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.6);
    color: rgba(255, 200, 100, 0.85);
    font-family: "Cinzel", "Palatino Linotype", serif;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 120, 0, 0.5);
    animation: serie-m-glow 3s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
  }
  .serie-m__hint .hint-rune {
    font-size: 1.1em;
  }
  .serie-m__hint .hint-rune:last-child {
    transform: scaleX(-1);
  }

  /* Texto narrativo */
  .serie-m__info {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 3;
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding: 0 1.6rem;
    max-width: 42rem;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }
  .serie-m__info p {
    color: var(--color-gold-light);
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 4.4vw, 1.35rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 2px #000,
      0 1px 16px #080300,
      0 1px 24px #000;
  }
  .serie-m__title {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 0.85rem;
    font-family: "Cinzel", serif;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 5.6vw, 1.85rem);
    color: #bf6515;
    text-shadow:
      0 0 2px #000,
      0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8),
      0 0 8px rgba(212, 175, 55, 0.6);
    filter: contrast(1.15) brightness(1.1) saturate(1.2);
  }

  @keyframes serie-m-glow {
    0% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(136, 54, 0, 0.2);
    }
    50% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(139, 88, 0, 0.5);
    }
    100% {
      box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(116, 47, 1, 0.2);
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    .serie-m__hint {
      animation: none;
    }
    .serie-m__portal img {
      transition: none;
    }
  }
</style>
